Goose
https://github.com/aardappel/goose
By Wouter van Oortmerssen, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Helium's memory model and core language semantics started from Goose, and this
repository's git history begins with Goose's. The following still contain
material from Goose, modified for Helium (converted to Helium syntax,
renamed, extended or partly rewritten):
  test/, samples/  most of the test corpus and the numbered samples
  hc/lib/          std.he, json.he, regex.he, dictionary.he, binary.he,
                   vec.he and exception.he, translated from Goose's stdlib
  bench/heavyweights/helium/bintrees.amni

